  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MongoDBOASIS v2.0.4\n\nConnects the OASIS to MongoDB -- the world's leading NoSQL document database with flexible schema, rich querying, horizontal sharding, and Atlas cloud hosting. The recommended default persistence backend for self-hosted OASIS ONODE deployments. Stores all OASIS holons, avatars, karma records, and key-value data as BSON documents. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- feat: complete Edge offline runtime and release automation (279c090)\n- fix(mongo): accept equivalent public identity index (ed6a928)\n- fix(mongo): load avatar details with karma history (68a7860)\n- Keep HyperDrive provider failures from stopping APIs (b4dd39d)\n- Publish karma settings initialization and quest completion timestamps (0fa3c06)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MongoOASIS",
